#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:5 f5e6573ebb5e455281f34a6e74a8b8f8
msgid "GCS Resources"
msgstr "GCS 资源"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:7 ce9f05596dfc4ecdbd2522b37c8a31a9
msgid ""
"This section explains what resources the ArduPilot makes available for GCS "
"authors to enhance their interfaces with metadata."
msgstr "本节介绍 ArduPilot 为 GCS 开发者提供哪些资源，以便通过元数据增强其界面。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:10 487814c2d39c4a6a8b1d9a3e6c4cbb53
msgid "Parameter Definitions"
msgstr "参数定义"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:12 820e3faa11d845b49bdf570b21d87bbb
msgid ""
"Textual descriptions of parameters, expected value ranges and other "
"information is available from our parameter metadata.  It is available in a "
"range of formats from (e.g) "
"https://autotest.ardupilot.org/Parameters/ArduCopter/"
msgstr ""
"参数的文字描述、预期值范围及其他信息可从我们的参数元数据获取。它以多种格式提供，例如 "
"https://autotest.ardupilot.org/Parameters/ArduCopter/"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:15 daea229e3e55443382d855498e014ab9
msgid "Onboard Log Definitions"
msgstr "机载日志定义"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:17 96c63b1ada3945cc82af2acec75e15ac
msgid ""
"While ArduPilot's onboard logs are self-describing - in that they contain "
"information within themselves that describes the available messages and "
"fields, we provide more metadata that would be problematic to provide in an "
"embedded software image."
msgstr ""
"虽然 ArduPilot 的机载日志是自描述的——即它们自身包含描述可用消息和字段的信息，但我们还提供更多在嵌入式软件镜像中难以提供的元数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:19 d465e0ba658d4fdb83798975d7477008
msgid ""
"That data is available in a variety of formats from our autotest server: "
"https://autotest.ardupilot.org/LogMessages/"
msgstr "该数据以多种格式从我们的自动测试服务器提供：https://autotest.ardupilot.org/LogMessages/"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:24 398e9e8c7fec4f8096cfa37f34ebc9e8
msgid "GCS Maintainers List"
msgstr "GCS 维护者列表"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:26 7defcae5b7da45ffac6b986896b1951e
msgid ""
"We have a low-bandwidth mailing list where we announce significant changes "
"to ArduPilot's GCS-facing functionality, usually to do with how we handle "
"mavlink streams."
msgstr "我们有一个低带宽邮件列表，用于宣布 ArduPilot GCS 相关功能的重大变更，通常涉及我们处理 MAVLink 数据流的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:28 b3a72a5d641746bfb52dac11f0b12ab7
msgid ""
"That `forum <https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/ardupilot-gcs>`__ is "
"currently on google groups."
msgstr ""
"该 `论坛 <https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/ardupilot-gcs>`__ 目前在 Google "
"Groups 上。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:32 972f4d3a42a84b4d87a21587a4d24c75
msgid "SRTM Data"
msgstr "SRTM 数据"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:34 7713cdb5c4824cf08e5c2a00cd69660a
msgid ""
"The entire SRTM database is available at https://firmware.ardupilot.org/SRTM"
" .  This data gives approximate terrain height for most of the planet."
msgstr ""
"完整的 SRTM 数据库可从 https://firmware.ardupilot.org/SRTM 获取。该数据提供了地球大部分地区的近似地形高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:37 ea1bb73b3f84402ab455a56e68420de8
msgid "Firmware Manifest"
msgstr "固件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-resources.rst:39 a99f5928f8914a4c943cac0926572716
msgid ""
"The firmware available to be downloaded from our firmware server is "
"catalogued in a JSON file available from `here "
"<https://http://autotest.ardupilot.org/manifest.json.gz>`__."
msgstr ""
"可从我们固件服务器下载的固件目录记录在 JSON 文件中，可从 `这里 "
"<https://http://autotest.ardupilot.org/manifest.json.gz>`__ 获取。"

